# A68-A70 (TeraDesk via #Z, sd-tera): the A56 h02-info sequence (open the C:
# window by double-clicking HARD DISC C (195,35), click (220,340), File (88,8),
# Info... (110,43) -> "Disk Volume Information" dialog: FL3DBAK G_FTEXT labels
# with TRANSPARENT hollow-white te_color = the A69 case), OK (355,377) closes it;
# then the A57 alert: select HARD DISC F (435,35), File / Info... -> form_alert
# "Drive does not exist." (FL3DACT G_BUTTON + FL3DBAK/OUTLINED root = A70's
# unchanged neighbours). Ticks are 200 Hz after the injector arms.
1200 park
1206 move 300 300
1400 move 195 35
1600 down
1603 up
